    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Hops used in Brewing, Malting & Distilling: Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. BEER"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "After the end of a year or two, hops are reckoned to have lost much of their marketable value, and are then sold to the second-rate porter brewers, under the name of old hops."@en ;
